-- Seed data for BusStop, BusRoute, and RouteStop, derived from .local-resources/bali_transit.gpkg
-- (bus_stops / bus_routes layers).
--
-- id columns use deterministic UUIDv5s (namespaced off the source gpkg's stop_id / route_id),
-- kept separate from the natural source keys since those can be renumbered/changed upstream.
-- BusStop.stopId retains the original gpkg stop_id. BusRoute.ref is suffixed with the direction
-- id (e.g. K1B-0 / K1B-1) since each physical route has one row per direction and BusRoute.ref
-- must be unique. RouteStop.sequence is parsed from the trailing number in the source stop_id.



